    DEC{"v1 decision (§05.5 item 18, P1):<br/>BUILD the benefits data model now,<br/>DEFER the monetisation"}

    subgraph REASONS["Four independent reasons to build the model in v1"]
        direction TB
        R1["1 · Correctness, not monetisation<br/>Payroll must value every perquisite<br/>and reflect it in s.392 TDS (ex-s.192)<br/>+ Form 123 (ex-12BA) and Form 138 Annexure II data<br/><i>A benefit the engine cannot see, it mis-taxes</i>"]
        R2["2 · Retrofit is expensive<br/>Benefits touch employee master, CTC/FBP,<br/>tax engine, payslip, filings, audit trail<br/>Empty tables in v1 = a schema;<br/>adding in v2 = data migration + historical re-compute"]
        R3["3 · Option value on attach<br/>If §20 validates broker override / NPS POP,<br/>turn on against a populated model in weeks;<br/>skip it and re-underwrite later at full cost"]
        R4["4 · De-risks a dated reg window<br/>1 Apr 2026: meal ₹50 → ₹200/meal,<br/>gift ₹5,000 → ₹15,000 per tax year (~3.8× wallet)<br/>Needs wallet-config + proof-of-spend to exist,<br/>and the conditions enforced as engine rules (BEN-62, BEN-63)"]
    end

